    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Network Failure Recovery\r\n\r\nA user submitted Ticket #1001 — the app kept spinning and never completed their purchase.\r\n\r\nSketch what the user should see instead. Your design must include:\r\n\r\n1. **The Message:** Explain what happened in plain English. No error codes, no technical jargon.\r\n2. **The Action:** Give the user a clear next step — a Retry button, Contact Support link, or Return to Home option.\r\n3. **The Tone:** Keep it calm and helpful. No scary icons, no blame.",
